The following files are unmodified GCC runtime support routines:

    riscv_subsystem/sw/div.S
    riscv_subsystem/sw/muldi3.S
    riscv_subsystem/sw/riscv-asm.h

They are licensed under GPL-3.0 WITH the GCC Runtime Library Exception (the
exception notice is present in each of the three files), which explicitly
permits linking them into binaries under other licenses. See
https://www.gnu.org/licenses/gcc-exception-3.1.html

